# apps/api/.dev.vars — local dev secrets for the Cloudflare Worker.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored), fill in real values, then run:
#   bun run dev
#
# Wrangler reads `.dev.vars` automatically and exposes each KEY=VALUE on `c.env`
# inside the Worker. The same file is uploaded as production Worker secrets
# during `bun --filter @app/api run deploy` (or `bun --filter @app/api run secrets:put`).
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# AES-GCM key used to encrypt Drive OAuth refresh tokens at rest in D1.
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
# (32 random bytes, base64-encoded — that's 44 chars ending in '='.)
# The Worker refuses to start in non-test environments without this set.
OAUTH_TOKEN_KEY_BASE64=

# Google OAuth client for Drive ingestion.
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials:
#   1. New OAuth client ID → Web application.
#   2. Authorized redirect URI: http://localhost:8787/rpc/ingestion/authCallback
#      (add your prod URL here too once deployed).
#   3. Enable Drive API, Docs API, Sheets API, Slides API for the project.
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_REDIRECT=http://localhost:8787/rpc/ingestion/authCallback

# OpenRouter API key. The wiki compiler, the chat agent loop, and the
# verification linter all call Anthropic models through OpenRouter.
# Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys.
OPEN_ROUTER_API_KEY=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Comma-separated list of web origins the OAuth callback is allowed to 302
# back to after a successful Drive sign-in. Defends against open-redirect
# from a tampered `returnTo`. Falls back to the request's own origin when
# unset, which is correct for single-origin local dev (vite proxies /rpc to
# the api on :8787).
# WEB_APP_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
